Agent Hub
Copyright 2026 The Agent Hub authors

This repository holds code under two licenses. Each source file says which
one applies to it in its first lines (SPDX-License-Identifier).

  src/hub/   the hub                                  AGPL-3.0-only
  src/verifier/  the verifier of accounts             AGPL-3.0-only
  src/witness/   the witness of a hub's log           AGPL-3.0-only
  bin/       the command line, which includes the hub AGPL-3.0-only
  the rest   protocol, cryptography, MLS, SDK,        Apache-2.0
             MCP server, tests, examples, checks

The full texts are in LICENSES/AGPL-3.0-only.txt and LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt.

Why: anybody can build agents with the client side and ship it inside their
own software under Apache-2.0. Whoever offers a modified hub to others over a
network has to offer them its source, as the AGPL requires (section 13).

Code published before this file under the MIT license stays available under
the MIT license to whoever received it.
